<title>UK: Yorkshire Water year profits higher.</title>
<headline>Yorkshire Water year profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 46.1		  vs  36.0</p>
<p> Shr (pence) (adjusted)  47.1		  vs  46.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  13.4		  vs   n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  18.5		  vs  15.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     215.8		  vs 162.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   622.8		  vs 579.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Pretax profit in 1995/96 before exceptional drought costs was 209.4 million stg. Total dividend and EPS figures for 1995/96 adjusted for capital reorganisation.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 211 and 220 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Yorkshire Water Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
